### Security Considerations

Some third-party components may have known security vulnerabilities. We regularly update dependencies and provide security advisories when necessary. Users should:

1. Keep dependencies updated to the latest secure versions
2. Monitor security advisories for EdgeWatch and its dependencies
3. Implement appropriate security controls in their deployment environment
4. Report security vulnerabilities through our responsible disclosure process

